
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Channel Partner Revamp — Product Design Case Study">
<title>Channel Partner Revamp | UX Case Study</title>

<style>
:root {
  --primary: #6838D3;
  --primary-dark: #42208F;
  --primary-light: #F1ECFF;
  --ink: #211637;
  --muted: #716A80;
  --border: #E9E4F2;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --bg: #FAF9FD;
  --green: #19845B;
  --radius: 20px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
    "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

button { font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }

.container {
  width: min(1160px, 92%);
  margin: auto;
}

.section { padding: 90px 0; }

.section-head {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--primary);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4 {
  line-height: 1.2;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
}

h1 { font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 76px); }
h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px); }
h3 { font-size: 21px; }

p { color: var(--muted); }

.grid {
  display: grid;
  gap: 22px;
}

.grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
.grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }

.card {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 28px;
}

.card p { margin-bottom: 0; }

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--primary-light);
  color: var(--primary-dark);
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 7px 13px;
  margin: 4px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--primary);
  color: white;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 13px 23px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.btn:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }

.btn-outline {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid #C9B8F4;
  color: var(--primary);
}

.btn-outline:hover {
  background: var(--primary-light);
}

/* NAVIGATION */

nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.94);
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.nav-inner {
  min-height: 72px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 850;
  color: var(--primary-dark);
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 23px;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

.menu-toggle {
  display: none;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  font-size: 25px;
}

/* HERO */

.hero {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, #DCD0FF 0, transparent 40%),
    linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF, #F1ECFF);
  padding: 95px 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: center;
}

.hero h1 { margin: 18px 0; }

.hero p {
  font-size: 18px;
  max-width: 520px;
}

.hero-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 28px;
}

/* PRODUCT MOCKUP */

.mockup {
  background: #282239;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 28px 65px #34205D30;
}

.mockup-screen {
  min-height: 350px;
  background: #FAF9FE;
  border-radius: 11px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.mockup-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: white;
  padding: 14px 18px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  font-size: 12px;
}

.mockup-header strong { color: var(--primary); }

.mockup-content { padding: 22px; }

.mockup-content h3 { margin: 0 0 5px; }

.mockup-content > p {
  margin: 0 0 18px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 10px;
}

.stat {
  background: white;
  padding: 15px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
}

.stat strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 19px;
  color: var(--primary-dark);
}

.stat span {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.mock-table {
  margin-top: 16px;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.mock-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 12px;
  font-size: 11px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.mock-row:last-child { border: none; }

.status {
  display: inline-block;
  width: fit-content;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  font-size: 10px;
  background: #E8F6EF;
  color: var(--green);
}

.status.pending {
  background: #FFF2D6;
  color: #976000;
}

/* PROBLEM */

.old-process {
  background: #FFF8F6;
  border-color: #F6DCD6;
}

.new-process {
  background: #F4F0FF;
  border-color: #DED1FF;
}

.process-items {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 18px;
}

.process-items span {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

/* PERSONAS */

.persona-icon {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  background: var(--primary-light);
  border-radius: 13px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 23px;
}

/* FLOW */

.flow {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  overflow-x: auto;
  padding: 10px 0 20px;
}

.flow-step {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 155px;
  padding: 20px 14px;
  text-align: center;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 15px;
}

.flow-step .number {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--primary);
  color: white;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  margin: auto;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.flow-step h4 { margin: 14px 0 6px; }

.flow-step p {
  font-size: 12px;
  margin: 0;
}

.flow-arrow {
  align-self: center;
  color: var(--primary);
  font-size: 22px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* SOLUTION */

.solution {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr;
  gap: 35px;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 30px;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.solution:nth-child(even) {
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
}

.solution:nth-child(even) .solution-text { order: 2; }
.solution:nth-child(even) .ui-panel { order: 1; }

.solution-number {
  color: var(--primary);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.ui-panel {
  background: #F6F3FF;
  border: 1px solid #E6DCFF;
  border-radius: 17px;
  padding: 20px;
}

.ui-window {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 13px;
  padding: 18px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px #3D28700D;
}

.ui-window h4 { margin: 0 0 15px; }

.field {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 10px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin: 9px 0;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.alert {
  padding: 13px;
  background: #FFF3D9;
  border: 1px solid #F6D99C;
  border-radius: 9px;
  color: #805500;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.project-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.project-visual {
  height: 100px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #B9A4F4, #EDE7FF);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 40px;
}

.project-info { padding: 15px; }

.project-info p { font-size: 12px; }

.mini-button {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--primary-light);
  color: var(--primary);
  padding: 7px 12px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* IMPACT */

.impact {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2E175F, #6535B9);
  color: white;
}

.impact h2, .impact h3 { color: white; }

.impact p { color: #E2D9FA; }

.impact .card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.10);
  border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.18);
}

.impact .card p { color: #E8E1FA; }

.quote {
  font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 29px);
  font-weight: 650;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: white;
  max-width: 920px;
}

footer {
  background: #1F1437;
  color: white;
  padding: 45px 0;
}

footer p { color: #C9BDE4; }

.reveal {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(25px);
  transition: .65s ease;
}

.reveal.visible {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

/* RESPONSIVE */

@media(max-width: 900px) {
  .hero-layout,
  .solution,
  .solution:nth-child(even) {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .solution:nth-child(even) .solution-text,
  .solution:nth-child(even) .ui-panel {
    order: initial;
  }

  .grid-3, .grid-4 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

@media(max-width: 650px) {
  .section { padding: 60px 0; }

  .hero { padding: 65px 0; }

  .grid-2, .grid-3, .grid-4 {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 72px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: white;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .nav-links.open { display: flex; }

  .menu-toggle { display: block; }

  .solution { padding: 18px; }

  .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }

  .mockup-content { padding: 12px; }

  .stat { padding: 9px; }

  .stat strong { font-size: 15px; }

  .mock-row { font-size: 9px; }

  .flow-step { min-width: 145px; }
}

@media(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    transition-duration: .01ms !important;
  }
  .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- NAVIGATION -->
<nav>
  <div class="container nav-inner">
    <a href="#top" class="logo">Channel Partner / Case Study</a>

    <button class="menu-toggle"
      aria-label="Toggle navigation"
      aria-expanded="false">☰</button>

    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
      <a href="#research">Research</a>
      <a href="#journey">User Flow</a>
      <a href="#solutions">Solutions</a>
      <a href="#impact">Impact</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="container hero-layout">

    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Product Design Case Study</span>

      <h1>Channel Partner<br>Revamp</h1>

      <p>
        Designing a unified digital experience for real estate
        channel partners to onboard, manage customer leads,
        explore projects, track bookings, and understand commissions.
      </p>

      <div>
        <span class="tag">UX Research</span>
        <span class="tag">User Flows</span>
        <span class="tag">Product Design</span>
        <span class="tag">Enterprise Platform</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#overview" class="btn">Explore Case Study</a>
        <a href="#solutions" class="btn btn-outline">View Solutions</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mockup" aria-label="Illustrative dashboard mockup">
      <div class="mockup-screen">
        <div class="mockup-header">
          <strong>◈ Channel Partner</strong>
          <span>Dashboard · Leads · Projects</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mockup-content">
          <h3>Partner Dashboard</h3>
          <p>Your partner workspace, all in one place.</p>

          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>Leads</strong>
              <span>Customer pipeline</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>Visits</strong>
              <span>Site schedules</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>Bookings</strong>
              <span>Booking visibility</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mock-table">
            <div class="mock-row">
              <strong>Customer</strong>
              <strong>Project</strong>
              <strong>Status</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-row">
              <span>Customer A</span>
              <span>Project One</span>
              <span class="status">Site Visit</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-row">
              <span>Customer B</span>
              <span>Project Two</span>
              <span class="status pending">Follow-up</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-row">
              <span>Customer C</span>
              <span>Project Three</span>
              <span class="status">Booking</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</header>

<!-- OVERVIEW -->
<section class="section" id="overview">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">01 / Project Overview</span>
      <h2>Bringing the partner journey into one platform.</h2>
      <p>
        Sumadhura's channel partners needed a clearer way
        to manage their relationship with the organization,
        from registration and customer lead submission to
        project discovery and booking visibility.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Organization</span>
        <h3>Sumadhura</h3>
        <p>Real Estate</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">My Role</span>
        <h3>Product Designer</h3>
        <p>End-to-end UX and UI design</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Platform</span>
        <h3>Partner Portal</h3>
        <p>Responsive digital experience</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Collaboration</span>
        <h3>Cross-functional</h3>
        <p>MIS, pre-sales, stakeholders, and developers</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROBLEM -->
<section class="section" style="background:white" id="problem">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">02 / Problem</span>
      <h2>A fragmented workflow created repeated follow-ups.</h2>
      <p>
        Before the revamp, partners shared customer information
        through WhatsApp, Excel, and verbal communication.
        They often contacted multiple departments to establish
        lead ownership, check progress, and get updates.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card old-process reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Before</span>
        <h3>Disconnected partner experience</h3>
        <p>
          Customer information moved between partners,
          MIS, and pre-sales without a single, easily
          accessible view of the entire journey.
        </p>
        <div class="process-items">
          <span>WhatsApp</span>
          <span>Excel</span>
          <span>Verbal updates</span>
          <span>Repeated calls</span>
          <span>Manual follow-ups</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card new-process reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Design Direction</span>
        <h3>One connected partner workspace</h3>
        <p>
          Bring onboarding, lead activity, site visits,
          project information, booking visibility, and
          commission-related information into a
          structured partner experience.
        </p>
        <div class="process-items">
          <span>Registration</span>
          <span>Leads</span>
          <span>Site Visits</span>
          <span>Projects</span>
          <span>Bookings</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- RESEARCH -->
<section class="section" id="research">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">03 / User Research</span>
      <h2>Understanding different partner needs.</h2>
      <p>
        I gathered requirements through discussions
        with external and internal channel partners
        and considered the operational workflows
        involving MIS and pre-sales teams.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="persona-icon">👤</div>
        <h3>External Channel Partners</h3>
        <p>
          Needed simple registration, customer lead
          tracking, visit scheduling, project details,
          booking status, and commission visibility.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="persona-icon">🏢</div>
        <h3>Internal Channel Partners</h3>
        <p>
          Needed easier access to project knowledge,
          video tutorials, and learning incentives
          to support customer conversations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="persona-icon">✓</div>
        <h3>MIS Team</h3>
        <p>
          Responsible for verifying partner details
          and managing the approval dependencies
          associated with partner registration.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card reveal" style="margin-top:24px">
      <span class="eyebrow">Key Research Insights</span>
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div>
          <h3>Lead visibility</h3>
          <p>
            One customer could be interested in multiple
            projects. Partners needed to track each lead
            without losing the customer context.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Project knowledge</h3>
          <p>
            Partners wanted project details, supporting
            documents, and video tutorials directly
            inside the portal.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Scheduling flexibility</h3>
          <p>
            Partners needed to schedule and reschedule
            visits when customer availability changed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Post-booking transparency</h3>
          <p>
            Partners wanted visibility into booking
            confirmation and applicable brokerage
            or commission information.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- USER SEGMENTATION -->
<section class="section" style="background:white">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">04 / Information Architecture</span>
      <h2>One platform, multiple partner journeys.</h2>
      <p>
        External partners could register as individuals
        or companies, with separate paths for new and
        existing Sumadhura partners.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>Individual Partner</h3>
        <div class="process-items">
          <span>New Individual CP</span>
          <span>Existing Individual CP</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          Registration captures the relevant personal
          information and routes the application
          through MIS verification.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>Company Partner</h3>
        <div class="process-items">
          <span>New Company CP</span>
          <span>Existing Company CP</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          Registration captures company-related
          information with the appropriate
          partner onboarding flow.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card reveal" style="margin-top:24px">
      <h3>Important Business Rule</h3>
      <p>
        While an external partner's MIS verification
        is pending, the partner can still submit
        customer leads. However, lead approval
        remains dependent on completion of
        partner verification.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- FLOW -->
<section class="section" id="journey">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">05 / User Journey</span>
      <h2>Designing the end-to-end experience.</h2>
      <p>
        The journey connects registration,
        verification, customer leads, project
        exploration, site visits, and booking visibility.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flow reveal">
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="number">1</div>
        <h4>Register</h4>
        <p>Phone verification and details</p>
      </div>

      <span class="flow-arrow">→</span>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="number">2</div>
        <h4>Verification</h4>
        <p>MIS reviews partner information</p>
      </div>

      <span class="flow-arrow">→</span>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="number">3</div>
        <h4>Submit Leads</h4>
        <p>Lead submission allowed while pending</p>
      </div>

      <span class="flow-arrow">→</span>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="number">4</div>
        <h4>Manage Visits</h4>
        <p>Schedule and reschedule</p>
      </div>

      <span class="flow-arrow">→</span>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="number">5</div>
        <h4>Track Booking</h4>
        <p>Check customer booking status</p>
      </div>

      <span class="flow-arrow">→</span>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="number">6</div>
        <h4>Commission</h4>
        <p>View applicable commission details</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size:13px">
      Note: This is a simplified journey diagram.
      Lead submission can happen before MIS verification
      is complete; lead approval is dependent on verification.
      Project exploration can occur throughout the journey.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- DESIGN CHALLENGE -->
<section class="section" style="background:white">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">06 / Design Challenge</span>
      <h2>Making a complex system feel simple.</h2>
      <p>
        The primary challenge was covering the complete
        partner journey without overwhelming users
